  "description": "ONE GIANT LEAP\nMACHINIST was built for those who move beyond the map. Forged from double-butted titanium and tuned for fast, rugged terrain, it glides over washboards, loose rock, and whatever else the backroads throw its way. Light but unyielding, it turns distance into dust, shrugs off abuse, and carries on with quiet precision. Whether you're hammering fire roads, ripping desert doubletrack, or vanishing into the wild for days on end, MACHINIST thrives where others turn back.\nDesigned around full electronic shifting and ENVE’s In-Route cockpit, MACHINIST brings titanium gravel technology into the 31st century. A single front chainring and clearance for 700 x 50mm tires equip your ride for whatever surface lies ahead, while a T47 bottom bracket and UDH dropouts ensure no setback becomes a dead end. A variety of braze-ons allow for mounting bags, racks, and extra bottles, preparing you for flint hills or firefighting—whatever you’re into. FKA MARAUDER!",
